    desc: 'Running for and holding office in HOSA at chapter or state level — a campaign, an election, and then a year of actually running an organisation of thousands of health-science students.', eligibility: 'HOSA members in good standing; state officer campaigns run at the spring state conference, and chapter officer elections happen every spring at your own school.',
